{
    "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
    "annotation": "RFEM Diffusion Uncertainty Quantification workflow for GDPS permeation analysis. Models spatially varying hydrogen diffusivity D(x) using a log-normal random field. BCs set from Sievert's law (C_upstream) and zero downstream concentration. Solves Fick's law: div(D grad C) = 0.",
